### Coupons
### --------------------------------------------------

### Create coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "code": "SAVE10",
  "discountType": "percentage",
  "discountValue": 10,
  "minOrderAmount": 50,
  "expiresAt": "2026-12-31T00:00:00.000Z",
  "isActive": true
}

