### --------------------------------------------------
### Shipments
### --------------------------------------------------

### Create shipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "carrier": "UPS",
  "trackingNumber": "1Z123456789",
  "status": "processing"
}

### Get all shipments
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{shipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update shipment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{shipmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "shipped",
  "trackingNumber": "1Z987654321"
}

### Delete shipment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{shipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

